<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Seagram cut on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Seagram cut on price.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Seagram Co Ltd to neutral from outperform on price.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 37-3/4 in U.S. trading on Wednesday.</p>
